nderline":false},"plain_text":"部室の入室および利用の資格を次の通り定める","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}]}},"children":[{"blockId":"279a501ef337801fab71e583e1274bf0","type":"paragraph","parent":{"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"color":"default","parent":[{"annotations":{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false},"plain_text":"(1) 部室を使用できる部は、プログラミング部Horizonに属しているものに限る。\n(2) 学内団体に属さないもの(Horizonに属さないもの)が個人または有志で利用する場合は、幹事長または各支部代表者を経由して許可を得なければならない。\n(3) 本学学生以外の者の入室は禁ずる。ただし、本学教職員および学生部の許可を得た者は、この限りではない。","href":null,"is_same_bp":false}]}},"children":[]}]}]},{"blockId":"279a501ef3378035bd82ed75113b57a6","type":"paragraph","parent":{"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"color":"default","parent":[]}},"children":[]}],"pageNavs":[{"title":"Home","link":"/posts"},{"title":"部活情報","link":"/posts/course/info"},{"title":"部室の場所とルール","link":"/posts/curriculums/279a501ef33780dfa164dcfbf444bd9d"}],"pageId":"279a501ef33780dfa164dcfbf444bd9d","iconUrl":"https://www.notion.so/icons/couch_green.svg","iconType":"external","coverUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ryukoku-Horizon/atlas-storage/main/notion_data/assets/279a501ef33780dfa164dcfbf444bd9d/cover.jpeg?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466YVMFH4JF%2F20260104%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260104T124831Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEGEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIQDrsPjAgcxiURkqxjwZsgw5KeYDyilb0EFgDAX%2ByXIi9QIgNQ2emljoNwM9WT%2Bz3FkQtQXTXK2eLngrvp1oPDXoErQq%2FwMIKhAAGgw2Mzc0MjMxODM4MDUiDEUWS6m7YiNTVy3HDCrcAwuCoL89%2BhqdIrBBzSq%2FHMktDLibaYornt6GLu8%2FFvhdyo%2Bk87cF929QtkinogVEdNJyBhQPyn9i2LWBfQZ0T2PcjgqPavR3yxTENJynMJM1BYIJr6lJg7VPXXCNHXurSUzEoAkHeUBoP5sw3H5U%2B10c6Rn2FkWFuwFeCaJ%2FjNf6novGplilvjD8qGWljRt%2BtI5lk5apCz8gGhFr1Tr22iEG6PYlK3itzqjEtSfOhW5cS4s5%2FA9QhGvnnO%2Bbe1di22ODe4TfmV9ykb0bbFS9K6WRLAcy6qEXCNogUEyT6KBDVKVDTglz4psiHnKPwCyBokZRz6fMZLxq3AGtHyOd9u38uXF6igSM%2BGOo2tOJEQA6hFo6PwQs77uFFqEI